mands with a `StringEncoder` in the TCP pipeline, and added `JmakProtocolEncoderTest`.\n- Learned: text (SMS) encoders are wired with `setTextCommandEncoder` + `setSupportedTextCommands` (see `WondexProtocol`); encoders with a channel flag are tested by calling `encodeCommand` directly (see `Tk103ProtocolEncoderTest`).\n- Left: the \"movement alarm\" is mapped to `Command.TYPE_ALARM_VIBRATION` because there is no movement command type; a maintainer should confirm. Set connection picks parameter 13 only for dotted IPv4 servers.\nEOF","description":"Append harness log entry"}}}
